  |            ^^^ this should be `Bool`
  = note: a name ending in `?` asks a yes-or-no question, so callers expect a `Bool`
help: return a `Bool`
  | def ok? -> Bool = 1
help: or, if it isn't a yes-or-no question, drop the `?` and call it `ok`
  | def ok -> Int = 1
  = see `wid explain E0330`

